--------------
Barding-Defense/Qwen3.8-27B-huihui-abliterated-NVFP4-NInfer:
https://huggingface.co/Barding-Defense/Qwen3.8-27B-huihui-abliterated-NVFP4-NInfer
Pinned artifact revision: 228612d2a1f48c9e1b6f5e102f369c133c0f6eec

The publisher identifies this artifact as Apache-2.0 and retains the
upstream checkpoint's LICENSE, including Copyright 2026 Alibaba Cloud.
The recipe downloads and verifies that LICENSE and the publisher NOTICE,
along with the model, artifact manifest, and conversion report. Those
original files are retained unchanged. They are authoritative for the
artifact's licensing and provenance.

