Recipe preparation changes
--------------------------
The recipe uses the pinned runtime's standard-library Python upgrader to
convert the publisher's NInfer v2 container to v3. Weight bytes are
preserved and the runtime's maintained Qwen3.8 chat template is installed.
The original artifact remains in place. The prepared artifact is stored
separately in v3/, alongside copies of the publisher LICENSE and NOTICE.
The generated upgrade-receipt.json records input/output identity and
checksums, upgrader provenance, and this statement of changes. It is not
a replacement for the publisher's original conversion report.

